// Voices Around the Corner: the outcome when the party pays for the player's silence.
Object.assign(EVENT_NARRATIVE_TRANSLATIONS.es, {
    "Three hands go to three weapons, then relax when they see you are alone.\n\n\"Your porter is fine,\" you say. \"He thinks he got lost.\"\n\nThe youngest one looks at his boots. The leader does not. He smiles, puts something in your hand and pats your cheek.\n\n\"For your trouble. He got lost. Didn't he.\"": "Tres manos van a tres armas. Luego se relajan al ver que estás solo.\n\n«Vuestro porteador está bien», dices. «Cree que se perdió».\n\nEl más joven se mira las botas. El jefe no. Sonríe, te pone algo en la mano y te da unas palmaditas en la mejilla.\n\n«Por las molestias. Se perdió. ¿Verdad?».",
});
Object.assign(EVENT_NARRATIVE_TRANSLATIONS.fr, {
    "Three hands go to three weapons, then relax when they see you are alone.\n\n\"Your porter is fine,\" you say. \"He thinks he got lost.\"\n\nThe youngest one looks at his boots. The leader does not. He smiles, puts something in your hand and pats your cheek.\n\n\"For your trouble. He got lost. Didn't he.\"": "Trois mains se portent sur trois armes, puis se détendent en voyant que vous êtes seul.\n\n« Votre porteur va bien, dites-vous. Il pense s’être perdu. »\n\nLe plus jeune regarde ses bottes. Pas le chef. Il sourit, vous glisse quelque chose dans la main et vous tapote la joue.\n\n« Pour le dérangement. Il s’est perdu. N’est-ce pas ? »",
});
Object.assign(EVENT_NARRATIVE_TRANSLATIONS.ru, {
    "Three hands go to three weapons, then relax when they see you are alone.\n\n\"Your porter is fine,\" you say. \"He thinks he got lost.\"\n\nThe youngest one looks at his boots. The leader does not. He smiles, puts something in your hand and pats your cheek.\n\n\"For your trouble. He got lost. Didn't he.\"": "Три руки тянутся к оружию, потом расслабляются: вы один.\n\n«Ваш носильщик в порядке, — говорите вы. — Думает, что заблудился».\n\nСамый младший смотрит на свои сапоги. Главарь — нет. Он улыбается, вкладывает что-то вам в руку и похлопывает по щеке.\n\n«За беспокойство. Он заблудился. Ведь так?»",
});

