    "All revealed enemies take 3 poison damage for 3 turns": "所有已翻开的敌人在3回合内每回合受到3点毒伤害",
    "Summons a hostile Mimic into an empty space. Defeat it before it escapes to claim its loot.": "在一个空格召唤一只敌对的宝箱怪。在它逃走前击败它，夺取战利品。",
    "Drop onto the board to summon a hostile Mimic in a free card space, even after combat. Defeat it before it escapes to claim its loot.": "放到场上，在空卡位召唤一只敌对的宝箱怪，战斗结束后也可以。在它逃走前击败它，夺取战利品。",
    "Summon a Mimic. Defeat it for loot.": "召唤一只宝箱怪。击败它获得战利品。",
    "Adds 3 burn to every enemy, including hidden ones. Burn deals its counter each turn, then drops by 1.": "给每个敌人施加3层灼烧，包括隐藏的。灼烧每回合造成等于层数的伤害，然后减少1。",
    "Apply 3 Burn to all enemies, even hidden ones.": "给所有敌人施加3层灼烧，包括隐藏的。",
    "Flips all revealed non-boss enemies face-down": "把所有已翻开的非首领敌人翻回背面",
    "Deals 3 lightning damage to all revealed enemies and shocks survivors for one missed attack, including bosses.": "对所有已翻开的敌人造成3点闪电伤害，并使存活者感电，落空一次攻击，首领也一样。",
    "Deal 3 damage and Shock all revealed enemies.": "对所有已翻开的敌人造成3点伤害并使其感电。",
    "Fully restores Action Points without healing HP.": "完全恢复行动点，但不恢复生命。",
    "Restore Action Points": "恢复行动点",
    "Each food you eat gives +1 max action point (up to +10 a run).": "每吃一份食物+1最大行动点（每次冒险最多+10）。",
    "Each companion that attacks has a 10% chance to act once more. Extra actions cannot chain.": "每个发动攻击的伙伴有10%几率再行动一次。额外行动不能连锁。",
    "3% chance to find a crystal when killing an enemy.": "击杀敌人时有3%几率找到一颗水晶。",
    "15% chance after a damaging weapon hit to reveal one face-down card that is not an enemy or a trap.": "造成伤害的武器命中后有15%几率翻开一张不是敌人也不是陷阱的背面卡牌。",
    "Discarding a card restores 1 pip to a random damaged weapon or armor item you keep, including worn armor. Cannot repair broken items.": "丢弃一张卡牌会为你保留的一件随机受损武器或护甲恢复1点耐久，包括穿着的护甲。无法修复已损坏的物品。",
